{
  "dom_id": "step-t2906",
  "name": "Introduction",
  "problem": "A **unit vector** is a vector whose magnitude is equal to $1.$ \n\nGiven any vector $\\mathbf a$, we can create a unit vector $\\mathbf u$ by dividing $\\mathbf a$ by its magnitude $|\\, \\mathbf{a} \\,|,$ as follows:\n\n$$\n\\mathbf{u} = \\dfrac{ \\mathbf{a} }{ |\\,\\mathbf{a}\\,| }\n$$\n\nFor example, if $|\\,\\mathbf{a}\\,|=2,$ then the unit vector is\n\n$$\n\\mathbf{u} = \\dfrac{\\mathbf{a}}{2} = \\dfrac{1}{2} \\mathbf{a}.\n$$\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14251721/assets/c78d5b75c1d5928e7b269a4a67229487b3d3324e9815b11c5fd1f47f63437d82.png)",
  "worked_solution": "",
  "calculator_instructions": "",
  "fields": [],
  "problem_field_keys": [],
  "answer_fields_complete": null,
  "result": null,
  "proof_feedback": null,
  "html": "<div id=\"step-t2906\" class=\"step\" style=\"display: block\">\n    \n               \n                <div class=\"tutorial\">\n                    <div class=\"stepHeader\">\n                        <div class=\"stepName\"><span class=\"stepType\">Introduction</span></div>       \n                        <div class=\"helpButton\" stepid=\"t2906\">?</div>\n                    </div>                    \n    \n                    <style type=\"text/css\">\n                            .mjpage .MJX-monospace {\n                            font-family: monospace\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage .MJX-sans-serif {\n                            font-family: sans-serif\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage {\n                            display: inline;\n                            font-style: normal;\n                            font-weight: normal;\n                            line-height: normal;\n                            font-size: 100%;\n                            font-size-adjust: none;\n                            text-indent: 0;\n                            text-align: left;\n                            text-transform: none;\n                            letter-spacing: normal;\n                            word-spacing: normal;\n                            word-wrap: normal;\n                            white-space: nowrap;\n                            float: none;\n                            direction: ltr;\n                            max-width: none;\n                            max-height: none;\n                            min-width: 0;\n                            min-height: 0;\n                            border: 0;\n                            padding: 0;\n                            margin: 0\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage * {\n                            transition: none;\n                            -webkit-transition: none;\n                            -moz-transition: none;\n                            -ms-transition: none;\n                            -o-transition: none\n                            }\n\n                            .mjx-svg-href {\n                            fill: blue;\n                            stroke: blue\n                            }\n\n                            .MathJax_SVG_LineBox {\n                            display: table!important\n                            }\n\n                            .MathJax_SVG_LineBox span {\n                            display: table-cell!important;\n                            width: 10000em!important;\n                            min-width: 0;\n                            max-width: none;\n                            padding: 0;\n                            border: 0;\n                            margin: 0\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage__block {\n                            text-align: center;\n                            margin: 1em 0em;\n                            position: relative;\n                            display: block!important;\n                            text-indent: 0;\n                            max-width: none;\n                            max-height: none;\n                            min-width: 0;\n                            min-height: 0;\n                            width: 100%\n                            }</style><p>A <strong>unit vector</strong> is a vector whose magnitude is equal to <span class=\"mjpage\"><svg xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" width=\"1.809ex\" height=\"2.176ex\" style=\"vertical-align: -0.338ex;\" viewBox=\"0 -791.3 779 936.9\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-1-Title\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-1-Title\">1.</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E1-MJMAIN-31\" d=\"M213 578L200 573Q186 568 160 563T102 556H83V602H102Q149 604 189 617T245 641T273 663Q275 666 285 666Q294 666 302 660V361L303 61Q310 54 315 52T339 48T401 46H427V0H416Q395 3 257 3Q121 3 100 0H88V46H114Q136 46 152 46T177 47T193 50T201 52T207 57T213 61V578Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E1-MJMAIN-2E\" d=\"M78 60Q78 84 95 102T138 120Q162 120 180 104T199 61Q199 36 182 18T139 0T96 17T78 60Z\"></path>\n</defs>\n<g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMAIN-31\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMAIN-2E\" x=\"500\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</svg></span> </p>\n<p>Given any vector <span class=\"mjpage\"><svg xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" width=\"1.299ex\" height=\"1.676ex\" style=\"vertical-align: -0.338ex;\" viewBox=\"0 -576.1 559.5 721.6\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-2-Title\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-2-Title\">\\mathbf a</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E2-MJMAINB-61\" d=\"M64 349Q64 399 107 426T255 453Q346 453 402 423T473 341Q478 327 478 310T479 196V77Q493 63 529 62Q549 62 553 57T558 31Q558 9 552 5T514 0H497H481Q375 0 367 56L356 46Q300 -6 210 -6Q130 -6 81 30T32 121Q32 188 111 226T332 272H350V292Q350 313 348 327T337 361T306 391T248 402T194 399H189Q204 376 204 354Q204 327 187 306T134 284Q97 284 81 305T64 349ZM164 121Q164 89 186 67T238 45Q274 45 307 63T346 108L350 117V226H347Q248 218 206 189T164 121Z\"></path>\n</defs>\n<g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E2-MJMAINB-61\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</svg></span>, we can create a unit vector <span class=\"mjpage\"><svg xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" width=\"1.485ex\" height=\"1.676ex\" style=\"vertical-align: -0.338ex;\" viewBox=\"0 -576.1 639.5 721.6\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-3-Title\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-3-Title\">\\mathbf u</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E3-MJMAINB-75\" d=\"M40 442L134 446Q228 450 229 450H235V273V165Q235 90 238 74T254 52Q268 46 304 46H319Q352 46 380 67T419 121L420 123Q424 135 425 199Q425 201 425 207Q425 233 425 249V316Q425 354 423 363T410 376Q396 380 369 380H356V442L554 450V267Q554 84 556 79Q561 62 610 62H623V31Q623 0 622 0Q603 0 527 -3T432 -6Q431 -6 431 25V56L420 45Q373 6 332 -1Q313 -6 281 -6Q208 -6 165 14T109 87L107 98L106 230Q106 358 104 366Q96 380 50 380H37V442H40Z\"></path>\n</defs>\n<g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E3-MJMAINB-75\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</svg></span> by dividing <span class=\"mjpage\"><svg xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" width=\"1.299ex\" height=\"1.676ex\" style=\"vertical-align: -0.338ex;\" viewBox=\"0 -576.1 559.5 721.6\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-4-Title\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-4-Title\">\\mathbf a</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E4-MJMAINB-61\" d=\"M64 349Q64 399 107 426T255 453Q346 453 402 423T473 341Q478 327 478 310T479 196V77Q493 63 529 62Q549 62 553 57T558 31Q558 9 552 5T514 0H497H481Q375 0 367 56L356 46Q300 -6 210 -6Q130 -6 81 30T32 121Q32 188 111 226T332 272H350V292Q350 313 348 327T337 361T306 391T248 402T194 399H189Q204 376 204 354Q204 327 187 306T134 284Q97 284 81 305T64 349ZM164 121Q164 89 186 67T238 45Q274 45 307 63T346 108L350 117V226H347Q248 218 206 189T164 121Z\"></path>\n</defs>\n<g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E4-MJMAINB-61\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</svg></span> by its magnitude <span class=\"mjpage\"><svg xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" width=\"4.014ex\" height=\"2.843ex\" style=\"vertical-align: -0.838ex;\" viewBox=\"0 -863.1 1728.3 1223.9\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-5-Title\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-5-Title\">|\\, \\mathbf{a} \\,|,</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E5-MJMAIN-7C\" d=\"M139 -249H137Q125 -249 119 -235V251L120 737Q130 750 139 750Q152 750 159 735V-235Q151 -249 141 -249H139Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E5-MJMAINB-61\" d=\"M64 349Q64 399 107 426T255 453Q346 453 402 423T473 341Q478 327 478 310T479 196V77Q493 63 529 62Q549 62 553 57T558 31Q558 9 552 5T514 0H497H481Q375 0 367 56L356 46Q300 -6 210 -6Q130 -6 81 30T32 121Q32 188 111 226T332 272H350V292Q350 313 348 327T337 361T306 391T248 402T194 399H189Q204 376 204 354Q204 327 187 306T134 284Q97 284 81 305T64 349ZM164 121Q164 89 186 67T238 45Q274 45 307 63T346 108L350 117V226H347Q248 218 206 189T164 121Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E5-MJMAIN-2C\" d=\"M78 35T78 60T94 103T137 121Q165 121 187 96T210 8Q210 -27 201 -60T180 -117T154 -158T130 -185T117 -194Q113 -194 104 -185T95 -172Q95 -168 106 -156T131 -126T157 -76T173 -3V9L172 8Q170 7 167 6T161 3T152 1T140 0Q113 0 96 17Z\"></path>\n</defs>\n<g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E5-MJMAIN-7C\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E5-MJMAINB-61\" x=\"445\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E5-MJMAIN-7C\" x=\"1171\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E5-MJMAIN-2C\" x=\"1449\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</svg></span> as follows:\n<span class=\"mjpage mjpage__block\"><svg xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" width=\"8.787ex\" height=\"5.509ex\" style=\"vertical-align: -2.671ex;\" viewBox=\"0 -1221.9 3783.4 2372\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-6-Title\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-6-Title\">\n\\mathbf{u} = \\dfrac{ \\mathbf{a} }{ |\\,\\mathbf{a}\\,| }\n</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E6-MJMAINB-75\" d=\"M40 442L134 446Q228 450 229 450H235V273V165Q235 90 238 74T254 52Q268 46 304 46H319Q352 46 380 67T419 121L420 123Q424 135 425 199Q425 201 425 207Q425 233 425 249V316Q425 354 423 363T410 376Q396 380 369 380H356V442L554 450V267Q554 84 556 79Q561 62 610 62H623V31Q623 0 622 0Q603 0 527 -3T432 -6Q431 -6 431 25V56L420 45Q373 6 332 -1Q313 -6 281 -6Q208 -6 165 14T109 87L107 98L106 230Q106 358 104 366Q96 380 50 380H37V442H40Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E6-MJMAIN-3D\" d=\"M56 347Q56 360 70 367H707Q722 359 722 347Q722 336 708 328L390 327H72Q56 332 56 347ZM56 153Q56 168 72 173H708Q722 163 722 153Q722 140 707 133H70Q56 140 56 153Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E6-MJMAINB-61\" d=\"M64 349Q64 399 107 426T255 453Q346 453 402 423T473 341Q478 327 478 310T479 196V77Q493 63 529 62Q549 62 553 57T558 31Q558 9 552 5T514 0H497H481Q375 0 367 56L356 46Q300 -6 210 -6Q130 -6 81 30T32 121Q32 188 111 226T332 272H350V292Q350 313 348 327T337 361T306 391T248 402T194 399H189Q204 376 204 354Q204 327 187 306T134 284Q97 284 81 305T64 349ZM164 121Q164 89 186 67T238 45Q274 45 307 63T346 108L350 117V226H347Q248 218 206 189T164 121Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E6-MJMAIN-7C\" d=\"M139 -249H137Q125 -249 119 -235V251L120 737Q130 750 139 750Q152 750 159 735V-235Q151 -249 141 -249H139Z\"></path>\n</defs>\n<g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E6-MJMAINB-75\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E6-MJMAIN-3D\" x=\"917\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<g transform=\"translate(1973,0)\">\n<g transform=\"translate(120,0)\">\n<rect stroke=\"none\" width=\"1569\" height=\"60\" x=\"0\" y=\"220\"></rect>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E6-MJMAINB-61\" x=\"505\" y=\"676\"></use>\n<g transform=\"translate(60,-771)\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E6-MJMAIN-7C\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E6-MJMAINB-61\" x=\"445\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E6-MJMAIN-7C\" x=\"1171\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</g>\n</g>\n</g>\n</svg></span></p>\n<p>For example, if <span class=\"mjpage\"><svg xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" width=\"8.275ex\" height=\"2.843ex\" style=\"vertical-align: -0.838ex;\" viewBox=\"0 -863.1 3562.9 1223.9\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-7-Title\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-7-Title\">|\\,\\mathbf{a}\\,|=2,</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E7-MJMAIN-7C\" d=\"M139 -249H137Q125 -249 119 -235V251L120 737Q130 750 139 750Q152 750 159 735V-235Q151 -249 141 -249H139Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E7-MJMAINB-61\" d=\"M64 349Q64 399 107 426T255 453Q346 453 402 423T473 341Q478 327 478 310T479 196V77Q493 63 529 62Q549 62 553 57T558 31Q558 9 552 5T514 0H497H481Q375 0 367 56L356 46Q300 -6 210 -6Q130 -6 81 30T32 121Q32 188 111 226T332 272H350V292Q350 313 348 327T337 361T306 391T248 402T194 399H189Q204 376 204 354Q204 327 187 306T134 284Q97 284 81 305T64 349ZM164 121Q164 89 186 67T238 45Q274 45 307 63T346 108L350 117V226H347Q248 218 206 189T164 121Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E7-MJMAIN-3D\" d=\"M56 347Q56 360 70 367H707Q722 359 722 347Q722 336 708 328L390 327H72Q56 332 56 347ZM56 153Q56 168 72 173H708Q722 163 722 153Q722 140 707 133H70Q56 140 56 153Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E7-MJMAIN-32\" d=\"M109 429Q82 429 66 447T50 491Q50 562 103 614T235 666Q326 666 387 610T449 465Q449 422 429 383T381 315T301 241Q265 210 201 149L142 93L218 92Q375 92 385 97Q392 99 409 186V189H449V186Q448 183 436 95T421 3V0H50V19V31Q50 38 56 46T86 81Q115 113 136 137Q145 147 170 174T204 211T233 244T261 278T284 308T305 340T320 369T333 401T340 431T343 464Q343 527 309 573T212 619Q179 619 154 602T119 569T109 550Q109 549 114 549Q132 549 151 535T170 489Q170 464 154 447T109 429Z\"></path>\n<path st